# Python bytecode. Running the mandated leak-check ritual generates these,
# and without this file a `git add -A` sweeps them into the commit — which
# is exactly how tools/__pycache__/leak_check.cpython-311.pyc ended up
# tracked in PR #6.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Build artifacts from the packaging ritual
*.zip
build/
dist/
# npm pack output. `npm pack` (without --dry-run) drops a tarball in the
# package dir; it is a build artifact and must never be committed.
*.tgz

# Environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

# OS and editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
